      </details>

      <details class='cl-faq-item'>
        <summary>{% if is_fr %}Comment fonctionnent les 3 zones de chauffe ?{% else %}How do the 3 heating zones work?{% endif %}<span class='cl-faq-toggle'>+</span></summary>
        <div class='cl-faq-body'><p>{% if is_fr %}Le boîtier de contrôle à 3 zones ajuste indépendamment la chaleur pour le haut du corps, la taille et le bas du corps, afin d'adapter la session à votre confort.{% else %}The 3-zone control box independently adjusts heat for upper body, waist, and lower body, so you can tune the session to your comfort.{% endif %}</p></div>
      </details>

      <details class='cl-faq-item'>
        <summary>{% if is_fr %}Que couvre l'essai de 30 jours ?{% else %}What does the 30-day trial cover?{% endif %}<span class='cl-faq-toggle'>+</span></summary>
        <div class='cl-faq-body'><p>{% if is_fr %}Testez CytoLight Sauna Dome chez vous pendant 30 jours. Si le produit ne vous convient pas, contactez le support pour organiser le retour.{% else %}Try CytoLight Sauna Dome at home for 30 days. If it is not right for you, contact support to arrange the return.{% endif %}</p></div>
      </details>

      {%- else -%}

      <details class='cl-faq-item'>
        <summary>{% if is_fr %}Combien de temps dure une s&eacute;ance ?{% else %}How long should each session be?{% endif %}<span class='cl-faq-toggle'>+</span></summary>
        <div class='cl-faq-body'><p>{% if is_fr %}Pour la plupart des personnes, <strong>10&#8211;20 minutes par s&eacute;ance</strong> est une bonne base. Les d&eacute;butants peuvent commencer par 5&#8211;10 minutes puis augmenter progressivement. Le minuteur int&eacute;gr&eacute; vous aide &agrave; garder une dur&eacute;e pr&eacute;cise et r&eacute;guli&egrave;re.{% else %}For most people, <strong>10&#8211;20 minutes per session</strong> is optimal. Beginners should start with 5&#8211;10 minutes and gradually increase. The CytoLight&#8217;s built-in smart timer lets you set precise session lengths and will alert you when your session is complete. Consistency matters more than duration &#8212; daily sessions of 10 minutes outperform occasional 30-minute sessions.{% endif %}</p></div>
      </details>

      <details class='cl-faq-item'>
        <summary>{% if is_fr %}&Agrave; quelle distance dois-je m'asseoir ?{% else %}How far should I sit from the panel?{% endif %}<span class='cl-faq-toggle'>+</span></summary>
        <div class='cl-faq-body'><p>{% if is_fr %}La distance recommand&eacute;e est de <strong>15&#8211;30 cm</strong> pour une bonne irradiance. Si vous ressentez trop de chaleur ou de sensibilit&eacute;, reculez simplement le panneau ; les b&eacute;n&eacute;fices restent int&eacute;ressants jusqu'&agrave; environ 50 cm.{% else %}The recommended distance is <strong>15&#8211;30 cm (6&#8211;12 inches)</strong> for maximum irradiance and therapeutic effect. At this range the CytoLight delivers its peak output across all 7 wavelengths. If you experience any warmth or sensitivity, simply move the panel slightly further away &#8212; the benefits remain significant up to 50 cm.{% endif %}</p></div>
      </details>

      <details class='cl-faq-item'>
        <summary>{% if is_fr %}Puis-je utiliser les 7 longueurs d'onde ensemble ?{% else %}Can I use all 7 wavelengths at the same time?{% endif %}<span class='cl-faq-toggle'>+</span></summary>
        <div class='cl-faq-body'><p>{% if is_fr %}Oui. Vous pouvez lancer les 7 longueurs d'onde pour une s&eacute;ance spectre complet, ou <strong>s&eacute;lectionner et ajuster chaque longueur d'onde ind&eacute;pendamment</strong> via l'&eacute;cran tactile ou l'application CytoLight.{% else %}Yes &#8212; and this is one of CytoLight&#8217;s most powerful features. You can run all 7 wavelengths simultaneously for a full-spectrum session, or <strong>select and adjust each wavelength independently</strong> via the touch screen or the CytoLight App. For example: run only 660nm + 850nm for deep muscle recovery, or only 590nm + 630nm for a skin-focused session.{% endif %}</p></div>
      </details>

      <details class='cl-faq-item'>
        <summary>{% if is_fr %}Est-ce adapt&eacute; &agrave; un usage quotidien ?{% else %}Is it safe to use every day?{% endif %}<span class='cl-faq-toggle'>+</span></summary>
        <div class='cl-faq-body'><p>{% if is_fr %}Oui. La luminoth&eacute;rapie rouge est <strong>sans UV, non ionisante et non invasive</strong>. Beaucoup d'utilisateurs l'int&egrave;grent &agrave; leur routine du matin ou du soir. Comme pour toute routine bien-&ecirc;tre, commencez doucement et adaptez selon votre ressenti.{% else %}Yes &#8212; daily use is not only safe but recommended. Red light therapy is <strong>non-thermal, non-ionising, and UV-free</strong>. Over 4,000 peer-reviewed clinical studies confirm its safety profile. The CytoLight is CE certified and FDA listed. Many users integrate it into their morning or evening routine 365 days a year with no adverse effects.{% endif %}</p></div>
      </details>

      <details class='cl-faq-item'>
        <summary>{% if is_fr %}Quelle diff&eacute;rence entre rouge et proche infrarouge ?{% else %}What is the difference between red and near-infrared light?{% endif %}<span class='cl-faq-toggle'>+</span></summary>
        <div class='cl-faq-body'><p>{% if is_fr %}<strong>La lumi&egrave;re rouge (590&#8211;660nm)</strong> agit surtout en surface, notamment pour les routines peau. <strong>Le proche infrarouge (810&#8211;940nm)</strong> p&eacute;n&egrave;tre plus profond&eacute;ment et convient mieux aux muscles, articulations et zones de r&eacute;cup&eacute;ration.{% else %}<strong>Red light (590&#8211;660nm)</strong> works primarily on the surface layers of the skin &#8212; ideal for collagen stimulation, skin texture, wound healing, and surface inflammation. <strong>Near-infrared light (810&#8211;940nm)</strong> penetrates deeper, reaching muscles, joints, tendons, and even bone tissue &#8212; making it the wavelength of choice for recovery, pain relief, and systemic benefits like improved mitochondrial function and circulation.{% endif %}</p></div>
      </details>

      <details class='cl-faq-item'>
        <summary>{% if is_fr %}Comment fonctionne l'application Bluetooth ?{% else %}How does the Bluetooth app work?{% endif %}<span class='cl-faq-toggle'>+</span></summary>
        <div class='cl-faq-body'><p>{% if is_fr %}T&eacute;l&eacute;chargez l'application <strong>CytoLight</strong> sur iOS ou Android, puis associez le panneau via Bluetooth 5.0. Vous pouvez ajuster l'intensit&eacute;, les minuteurs, les alarmes, les modes pr&eacute;r&eacute;gl&eacute;s et les pulsations depuis votre t&eacute;l&eacute;phone.{% else %}Download the free <strong>CytoLight App</strong> on iOS or Android and pair it with your CytoLight panel via Bluetooth 5.0. From the app you can: adjust each wavelength&#8217;s intensity individually, set custom timers and alarms, activate preset therapy modes (Recovery, Focus, Sleep, Skin), configure pulsing frequency (1&#8211;40 Hz), and sync multiple CytoLight devices. Wi-Fi connectivity also allows control when your phone is out of Bluetooth range.{% endif %}</p></div>
      </details>

      <details class='cl-faq-item'>
        <summary>{% if is_fr %}Produit-il de la chaleur ou des UV ?{% else %}Does it produce heat or UV radiation?{% endif %}<span class='cl-faq-toggle'>+</span></summary>
        <div class='cl-faq-body'><p>{% if is_fr %}CytoLight ne produit <strong>aucun rayonnement UV</strong>. Vous pouvez ressentir une chaleur douce &agrave; courte distance, surtout avec le proche infrarouge, mais ce n'est pas une chaleur UV. La gestion thermique garde l'appareil stable et silencieux.{% else %}The CytoLight produces <strong>no UV radiation</strong> whatsoever &#8212; it is completely safe for skin exposure without sunscreen. You may notice a mild, pleasant warmth at close distances (under 15 cm), particularly from the near-infrared wavelengths, but this is infrared warmth, not UV heat. The panel&#8217;s advanced thermal management keeps operating temperatures low and fan noise minimal.{% endif %}</p></div>
      </details>

      <details class='cl-faq-item'>
        <summary>{% if is_fr %}Puis-je l'utiliser &agrave; travers les v&ecirc;tements ?{% else %}Can I use it through clothing?{% endif %}<span class='cl-faq-toggle'>+</span></summary>
        <div class='cl-faq-body'><p>{% if is_fr %}Pour un effet optimal, utilisez CytoLight <strong>directement sur peau nue</strong>. Les tissus absorbent ou dispersent une partie de la lumi&egrave;re, ce qui r&eacute;duit la dose re&ccedil;ue. Pour le visage, asseyez-vous simplement face au panneau, sans couvrir la zone cibl&eacute;e.{% else %}We recommend using the CytoLight <strong>directly on bare skin</strong> for maximum therapeutic effect. Most fabrics absorb or scatter light significantly, reducing the irradiance reaching your tissue. Thin, light-coloured clothing may allow some near-infrared light to pass through, but the results will be substantially reduced. For face treatments, simply sit in front of the panel without covering the target area.{% endif %}</p></div>
      </details>

      <details class='cl-faq-item'>
        <summary>{% if is_fr %}Que couvre l'essai de 30 jours ?{% else %}What does the 30-day trial cover?{% endif %}<span class='cl-faq-toggle'>+</span></summary>
        <div class='cl-faq-body'><p>{% if is_fr %}Notre <strong>garantie satisfait ou rembours&eacute; de 30 jours</strong> vous laisse tester l'appareil chez vous. Si vous n'&ecirc;tes pas convaincu, contactez le support pour organiser le retour. La garantie de 2 ans couvre ensuite les d&eacute;fauts de fabrication et pannes mat&eacute;rielles.{% else %}Our <strong>30-day money-back guarantee</strong> is unconditional. If you are not satisfied for any reason within 30 days of delivery, contact our support team and we will arrange a full refund &#8212; no questions asked, no restocking fees. Simply return the panel in its original packaging. The 2-year warranty covers all manufacturing defects and hardware failures beyond the trial period.{% endif %}</p></div>
      </details>

      <details class='cl-faq-item'>
        <summary>{% if is_fr %}Qu'est-ce que la pulsation ?{% else %}What is pulsing and do I need it?{% endif %}<span class='cl-faq-toggle'>+</span></summary>
        <div class='cl-faq-body'><p>{% if is_fr %}<strong>La pulsation</strong> signifie que les LED s'allument et s'&eacute;teignent rapidement &agrave; une fr&eacute;quence donn&eacute;e, mesur&eacute;e en Hz. CytoLight permet de r&eacute;gler les pulsations de <strong>1 &agrave; 40 Hz par longueur d'onde</strong>. Le mode continu reste aussi disponible.{% else %}<strong>Pulsing</strong> means the LEDs rapidly switch on and off at a set frequency (measured in Hz). Emerging research suggests certain pulse frequencies may target specific biological processes &#8212; for example, 10 Hz pulsing for cognitive function and 40 Hz for neuroprotective effects. The CytoLight supports pulsing from <strong>1&#8211;40 Hz per wavelength</strong>, individually configurable. Continuous (non-pulsed) mode is also available and is the most widely studied in clinical literature.{% endif %}</p></div>
      </details>

      <details class='cl-faq-item'>
        <summary>{% if is_fr %}Au bout de combien de temps voit-on des r&eacute;sultats ?{% else %}How long before I see results?{% endif %}<span class='cl-faq-toggle'>+</span></summary>
        <div class='cl-faq-body'><p>{% if is_fr %}Les r&eacute;sultats d&eacute;pendent de l'objectif et de la r&eacute;gularit&eacute;. Certaines personnes ressentent plus d'&eacute;nergie ou un meilleur sommeil en 1&#8211;2 semaines ; la peau et la r&eacute;cup&eacute;ration demandent souvent plusieurs semaines. La cl&eacute; reste la constance.{% else %}Results vary by goal and consistency. Many users report noticing <strong>improved energy and sleep quality within 1&#8211;2 weeks</strong> of daily sessions. Skin improvements (texture, tone, fine lines) typically become visible after 4&#8211;8 weeks. For chronic pain or injury recovery, clinical studies show significant results at 4&#8211;12 weeks of regular use. The key is consistency &#8212; short daily sessions are more effective than infrequent long ones.{% endif %}</p></div>
      </details>

      <details class='cl-faq-item'>
        <summary>{% if is_fr %}CytoLight est-il adapt&eacute; aux animaux ?{% else %}Is the CytoLight safe for pets?{% endif %}<span class='cl-faq-toggle'>+</span></summary>
        <div class='cl-faq-body'><p>{% if is_fr %}La lumi&egrave;re rouge et proche infrarouge est aussi utilis&eacute;e en contexte v&eacute;t&eacute;rinaire. Gardez les m&ecirc;mes r&egrave;gles de prudence : <strong>ne dirigez pas la lumi&egrave;re vers les yeux</strong> et commencez par des s&eacute;ances courtes. En cas de doute, demandez conseil &agrave; votre v&eacute;t&eacute;rinaire.{% else %}Yes &#8212; red and near-infrared light therapy is used by veterinarians for joint pain, wound healing, and post-surgical recovery in animals. Many CytoLight users treat their dogs and cats alongside their own sessions. The same safety guidelines apply: <strong>avoid directing light into eyes</strong> (use the included goggles for yourself; keep pets&#8217; eyes away from the beam), and start with shorter sessions of 5 minutes before building up.{% endif %}</p></div>
      </details>
      {%- endif -%}

    </div>

    <div class='cl-faq-cta'>
      <p>{% if is_fr %}Encore une question ? Notre &eacute;quipe de sp&eacute;cialistes de la luminoth&eacute;rapie rouge est l&agrave; pour vous aider.{% else %}Still have questions? Our team of red light therapy specialists is here to help.{% endif %}</p>
      <a href='mailto:support@cytolight.com'>
        <svg width='16' height='16' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='2'><path d='M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z'/><polyline points='22,6 12,13 2,6'/></svg>
        {% if is_fr %}Contacter nos experts{% else %}Contact our experts{% endif %}
      </a>
